{"attack":"削掉身体上没用的部分。大幅提高自己的速度，同时体重也会变轻。","description":"陷入身体轻量化状态，速度会大幅度提高，体重也会变轻。\n令使用者的速度提升2级。\n同时令使用者的体重降低100kg，使打草结、踢倒对自身造成的伤害减弱，高温重压、重磅冲撞对自身造成的伤害加强，同时也使自己的高温重压、重磅冲撞威力下降。自身的体重小于200kg时，对方的自由落体对使用者能成功使用。\n当使用者体重降低至0.1kg后，再次使用身体轻量化不会继续降低体重，但仍然可以提升速度。\n速度提升效果可以被接棒，但体重减少效果不能被接棒。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Steelix","Level":8},{"Name":"Aron","Level":40},{"Name":"Lairon","Level":46},{"Name":"Aggron","Level":48},{"Name":"Klink","Level":20},{"Name":"Klang","Level":20},{"Name":"Klinklang","Level":20},{"Name":"Honedge","Level":8},{"Name":"Doublade","Level":0},{"Name":"Aegislash form:shield","Level":0},{"Name":"Minior form:meteor","Level":31},{"Name":"Minior form:core","Level":31},{"Name":"Celesteela","Level":30},{"Name":"Necrozma","Level":80},{"Name":"Necrozma form:dusk","Level":80},{"Name":"Necrozma form:dawn","Level":80},{"Name":"Stakataka","Level":35}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":["Roggenrola","Boldore","Gigalith","Trubbish","Garbodor","Vanillite","Vanillish","Vanilluxe"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Geodude","Geodude form:alolan","Graveler","Graveler form:alolan","Golem","Golem form:alolan","Forretress","Skarmory","Hakamo-o","Kommo-o"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}